      "content": "rebuild? how? i don't have anything left to rebuild with. the people i used to respect, the people who relied on me... they're all gonna see me at the very bottom. they're gonna see me as this pathetic joke who lost everything. it's not just the money, it's the humiliation. i feel like the only thing i have left is this crushing shame and no matter how much i try to \"heal,\" the damage is done. i'm just broken.",
